        <span itemprop="definition">(TMA/SS6000 available from Seiko Instruments, Inc.) a microporous membrane sample of 10 mm (TD) ⁇ 3 mm (MD) was heated at a speed of 5° C./minute from room temperature while being longitudinally drawn under a load of 2 g. A temperature at an inflection point observed near the melting point was regarded as a shutdown temperature.</span>
